# An ordinary rig project ignores generated code — see the .gitignore that
# `rig init` writes. This example commits it on purpose: CI runs
# `rig generate && rig check` here, so any drift between the schema and the
# generators shows up as a diff in review rather than as a surprise later.

# rig's working directory.
.rig/manifest.json

# Binaries
/bin/
